---
// src/pages/404.astro
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../config";
import { AlertTriangle, ArrowLeft, Calendar } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<Layout
  title="404 - Deployment Incident | Coins5"
  description="Incident 404: The requested route could not be found."
  lang="en"
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="min-h-[75vh] flex items-center justify-center py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 card-premium p-8 md:p-12 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl">
      <!-- LADO IZQUIERDO: HUMOR TÉCNICO -->
      <div
        class="flex flex-col justify-between border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r pb-6 md:pb-0 md:pr-8"
        style="border-color: var(--card-border);"
      >
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-500 mb-4 font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase">
            <AlertTriangle class="h-5 w-5" stroke-width="2" />
            <span class="data-lang-en">STATUS: 404_DEPLOYMENT_REVERTED</span>
            <span class="data-lang-es hidden">ESTADO: 404_DESPLIEGUE_REVERTIDO</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Contenido en Inglés -->
          <div class="data-lang-en">
            <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary mb-4 font-sans tracking-tight">
              Who let the Junior deploy on Friday?
            </h1>
            <p
              class="font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed p-4 rounded-xl border mb-6"
              style="background-color: var(--card-inner-bg); border-color: var(--card-border); color: var(--color-text-body);"
            >
              Someone gave production access to the junior developer on Friday at 4:55 PM. The CI/CD pipeline tried its best to save us, but this route was accidentally deleted along with the staging database.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Contenido en Español -->
          <div class="data-lang-es hidden">
            <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-primary mb-4 font-sans tracking-tight">
              ¿Quién dejó que el Junior deployara en viernes?
            </h1>
            <p
              class="font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed p-4 rounded-xl border mb-6"
              style="background-color: var(--card-inner-bg); border-color: var(--card-border); color: var(--color-text-body);"
            >
              Alguien le dio acceso a producción al programador Junior un viernes a las 4:55 PM. El pipeline de CI/CD intentó salvarlo, pero esta ruta fue borrada accidentalmente junto con la base de datos de pruebas.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <a
            href="/"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono font-bold px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg border transition-all"
            style="border-color: var(--card-border); color: var(--badge-text); background-color: var(--card-inner-bg);"
          >
            <ArrowLeft class="w-4 h-4" stroke-width="2" />
            <span class="data-lang-en">cd .. / Run before Git Blame</span>
            <span class="data-lang-es hidden">cd .. / Correr antes del Git Blame</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- LADO DERECHO: GANCHO COMERCIAL (CONVERSIÓN B2B) -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-between md:pl-4">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-secondary tracking-widest uppercase mb-3 block">
            Coins5 // Code Intelligence
          </span>

          <!-- Contenido en Inglés -->
          <div class="data-lang-en">
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-4 font-sans tracking-tight">
              Jokes aside, being blind in production is a nightmare.
            </h2>
            <p
              class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans transition-colors"
              style="color: var(--color-text-body);"
            >
              Relying on frustrated users to find out your system crashed is expensive. If your SaaS platform needs structured logging, active telemetry, clean architecture, or autonomous AI agents that actually generate ROI, let's talk.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Contenido en Español -->
          <div class="data-lang-es hidden">
            <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-primary mb-4 font-sans tracking-tight">
              Bromas aparte, estar a ciegas en producción es una pesadilla.
            </h2>
            <p
              class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 font-sans transition-colors"
              style="color: var(--color-text-body);"
            >
              Depender de que tus usuarios frustrados te avisen que tu sistema se cayó sale muy caro. Si tu plataforma SaaS necesita logs estructurados, telemetría activa, arquitectura limpia o agentes de IA autónomos que realmente generen ROI, hablemos.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <a
            href={siteConfig.calendlyUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="btn btn-block font-extrabold h-auto min-h-12 py-3 px-6 rounded-lg text-sm shadow-md transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98]"
            style="background-color: var(--cta-primary-bg); color: var(--cta-primary-text);"
          >
            <Calendar class="w-4 h-4 mr-2" stroke-width="2" />
            <span class="data-lang-en">Secure My Infrastructure (15-Min Call)</span>
            <span class="data-lang-es hidden">Blindar mi Infraestructura (Llamada 15 min)</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    const isSpanish =
      window.location.pathname.startsWith('/es/') ||
      (!window.location.pathname.startsWith('/en/') &&
        navigator.language.startsWith('es'));

    if (isSpanish) {
      document
        .querySelectorAll('.data-lang-en')
        .forEach((el) => el.classList.add('hidden'));
      document
        .querySelectorAll('.data-lang-es')
        .forEach((el) => el.classList.remove('hidden'));
      document.title = '404 - Incidente de Despliegue | Coins5';
      const backBtn = document.querySelector('a[href="/"]');
      if (backBtn) backBtn.setAttribute('href', '/es/');
    }
  </script>
</Layout>
